  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Arctic National Wildlife Refuge Boundary",
  "description": "Data Type: Boundaries; This dataset provides a digitized legal boundary for the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge as interpreted from the Federal Register. This data is current to 1995. Accuracy of these lines are to the nearest meter for arcs that follow section, township lines and aliquot part descriptions.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This dataset provides a digitized legal refuge boundary of the Arctic National Wildlife Refuge as described in the Federal Register. These data are appropriate for a variety of resource evaluation purposes.",
